@ngocdung12112000:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
# Auth for npm.pkg.github.com is NOT set here: pnpm ignores ${ENV} tokens in a project .npmrc.
# Put it in your user-level ~/.npmrc (see CLAUDE.md "GitHub Packages auth"):
#   //npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=<PAT with read:packages>
# In CI, actions/setup-node (registry-url + NODE_AUTH_TOKEN) writes the user-level file.
